text:
@Neighbor
According to whose doctrine you are going to hell? I haven't heard the word hell mentioned at Imago in ages, if ever. Christians just don't know what to think about hell anymore, especially after Rob Bell told us Hell is fiction. 
So I don't know where you have gleaned this doctrine of Imago Dei, because it is not on their website or preached from the stage on Sunday.

